<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lincoln National raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lincoln National raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oppenheimer &amp; Co upgraded Lincoln National Corp to market outperform from market perform, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- On Monday, Lincoln Nation agreed to acquire CIGNA Corp's individual life insurance and annuity business for $1.4 billion in cash.</p>
<p>-- Lincoln National gained 7/16 to 67-7/16.</p>
</text>
